WEBVTT

00:00:09.417 --> 00:00:10.416
[gasps]

00:00:10.417 --> 00:00:11.667
Emily?

00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:14.499
[Jessie whistles]

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.082
- Daffodil, dig.
- [whinnies]

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.417
[blusters]

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.666
[blusters]

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:24.542
[music continues]

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:32.082
[lock clicks]

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.999
[♪ melancholy music plays]

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.125
Wait.

00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:38.457
This ain't stuff from Emily.

00:00:38.458 --> 00:00:39.542
It...

00:00:40.167 --> 00:00:41.292
It's newer.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.166
It doesn't make any sense.

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.374
She wouldn't have any of this stuff.

00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:48.958
She'd be...

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:54.082
all grown-up.

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:56.000
[♪ uplifting music plays]

00:00:57.542 --> 00:00:58.542
Wait.

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:03.792
Jessie, you will always be
my little cowgirl. Love, Mom

00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:08.167
Emily named her daughter...

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.500
after me.

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.667
Really?

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:28.042
[blusters]

00:01:29.708 --> 00:01:30.708
[nickers]

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:33.875
[music continues]

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:38.916
- [grass rustling]
- [blusters]

00:01:38.917 --> 00:01:40.291
- [whinnies]
- [♪ dramatic music plays]

00:01:40.292 --> 00:01:41.707
Uh...

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:43.666
[screams] Whoa!

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:45.166
[groans]

00:01:45.167 --> 00:01:46.542
[breathing heavily]

00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:49.666
Jessie? Bullseye!

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:50.957
- Hey, I found 'em!
- [♪ triumphant music plays]

00:01:50.958 --> 00:01:52.083
Woody?

00:01:53.042 --> 00:01:54.749
- Buzz!
- Jessie!

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:55.707
[grunts]

00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:56.874
You're okay.

00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:58.957
What... What are you doing here?

00:01:58.958 --> 00:02:00.582
We came for you, Jessie.

00:02:00.583 --> 00:02:01.707
For me?

00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:03.250
We all did.

00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:14.832
Well, howdy-do, Sheriff?

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:16.207
We come bearing Buzzes.

00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:18.707
Looks like 50 to me,
but I can only count to two.

00:02:18.708 --> 00:02:19.708
[gasps]

00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:23.416
Star Command. Star Command.
Star Command. Star Command.

00:02:23.417 --> 00:02:25.542
Star Command. Star Command. Star Command.

00:02:26.083 --> 00:02:27.416
Star Command.

00:02:27.417 --> 00:02:29.541
All right, all right, calm down.

00:02:29.542 --> 00:02:30.749
Give her some room, fellas.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.791
- Uh, Buzz.
- Yes?

00:02:32.792 --> 00:02:35.500
Hey, hey, she meant that for me. Just me.

00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.374
- We saw Bonnie give you away.
- You did?

00:02:38.375 --> 00:02:39.874
It doesn't make any sense.

00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:41.207
You're not useless, Sheriff!

00:02:41.208 --> 00:02:43.291
- We love you!
- So much!

00:02:43.292 --> 00:02:44.749
[Atlas sobbing]

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.458
[♪ melancholy music plays]

00:02:51.208 --> 00:02:52.583
Look, I'm okay.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:56.000
Bonnie's growing up.

00:02:57.208 --> 00:03:02.292
And we don't get to decide
when and how that happens.

00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:04.957
All that matters is

00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:06.999
we were there at the right time

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.749
to help her along.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.833
[blusters]

00:03:15.625 --> 00:03:17.708
And I gotta believe we were.

00:03:18.875 --> 00:03:20.916
You make us proud to be toys, Jessie.

00:03:20.917 --> 00:03:22.541
- What are you doing? Stop!
- [groaning]

00:03:22.542 --> 00:03:24.624
[clears throat] Sorry, guys. Sorry.

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:25.707
[blusters]

00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:28.708
Just wish she had at least
connected with Blaze.

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:30.916
Wait.

00:03:30.917 --> 00:03:33.166
- Connect! They still can!
- [♪ upbeat music plays]

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:34.749
Lilypad can do that!

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.083
- Lilypad?
- Lilypad?

00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:39.667
- [grunts]
- [beeps]

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.082
L it's J

00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:43.792
We need to talk

00:03:44.583 --> 00:03:46.249
Okay, okay. Guys, message coming through.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.249
"Jessie, I'm so sorry.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.332
Chose wrong friends. Hurt Bonnie."

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:51.541
- Oh, no.
- Bonnie.

00:03:51.542 --> 00:03:54.167
Smarty, send a reply. "You can fix it."

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.083
- [beeps]
- [gasps]

00:03:59.583 --> 00:04:02.207
"No, I can't. Threw myself away."

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:03.916
- What?
- "On donation truck."

00:04:03.917 --> 00:04:07.332
Jumpin' Jehoshaphat!
Now she throws herself away?

00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:09.207
[groans] We're goin' after her.

00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:10.499
- What?
- But how?

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.917
Smarty, tell Lily to send
a photo of where she is.

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:15.666
Got it.

00:04:15.667 --> 00:04:17.624
Snappy, zoom in on that blurry road sign.

00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:19.499
Look at you with that tech talk, cowgirl.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:20.791
Martin Avenue.

00:04:20.792 --> 00:04:22.374
Atlas, can you get us to that truck?

00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:24.291
Already mapped it, cowboy lady.

00:04:24.292 --> 00:04:26.666
Tell Lily to keep sending
photos of where she is.

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:28.082
We're getting her back.

00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:29.499
Yes, Sheriff.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.082
Jessie, when you have a moment,

00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:32.457
there's something you'd like to ask me...

00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:34.541
- I'd like to ask you.
- Sure thing, Deputy.

00:04:34.542 --> 00:04:36.583
- Now, a little help?
- Yes, Sheriff.

00:04:37.792 --> 00:04:39.541
<i>Yeehaw!</i>

00:04:39.542 --> 00:04:41.082
Let's ride.

00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:42.416
[♪ triumphant music plays]

00:04:42.417 --> 00:04:44.250
Whoa! Hey!

00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:48.541
- Hey! Hey, wait for us!
- Hey! Wait for us!

00:04:48.542 --> 00:04:49.624
[screams]

00:04:49.625 --> 00:04:50.875
- [squeaking]
- [grunts]

00:04:54.583 --> 00:04:55.666
[grunts]

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:56.833
[breathing heavily]

00:04:57.667 --> 00:04:58.499
[beeps]

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.416
On donation truck.

00:04:59.417 --> 00:05:01.000
Keep sending photos
We're coming

00:05:02.417 --> 00:05:04.207
- [music continues]
- She's not far.

00:05:04.208 --> 00:05:07.166
If we go south five blocks,
then east for two,

00:05:07.167 --> 00:05:08.166
we might be able to head 'em off

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:09.082
before they reach the highway.

00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:10.166
Car!

00:05:10.167 --> 00:05:11.333
[music stops]

00:05:13.542 --> 00:05:15.208
- Clear!
- [music resumes]

00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:16.832
She just passed a gas station.

00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:19.166
[laughs] Passed gas. Sorry, had to.

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:20.791
We're close. Take a shortcut.

00:05:20.792 --> 00:05:22.208
Down this next road to the right.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.375
- [squeaks]
- [grunts]

00:05:27.417 --> 00:05:28.249
It's a house!

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.666
I don't get it. There should be a road.

00:05:29.667 --> 00:05:31.999
Probably was a road
five years ago. Old map.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.332
- Recalculating.
- No time. We're going through.

00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:36.000
- [Buzz] Wait, what?
- [Woody] Going through?

00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:37.917
[music continues]

00:05:44.792 --> 00:05:45.750
[Smarty] Down, boy, down!

00:05:46.542 --> 00:05:47.541
[Woody screams]

00:05:47.542 --> 00:05:49.457
- [screams]
- [Buzz] Whoa, whoa.

00:05:49.458 --> 00:05:50.792
- [Woody grunts]
- [dog barks]

00:05:51.875 --> 00:05:53.082
[barking]

00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:54.499
- Yeehaw!
- [screams]

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.249
- [chicken squawks]
- [Jessie screams]

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.499
[squawking]

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.582
[music continues]

00:05:58.583 --> 00:05:59.750
[coughs]

00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:01.833
[chuckles]

00:06:03.917 --> 00:06:04.916
[shutter clicks]

00:06:04.917 --> 00:06:08.041
The truck. I see it up ahead.

00:06:08.042 --> 00:06:09.541
- [beeping]
- [♪ dramatic music plays]

00:06:09.542 --> 00:06:10.874
Follow me.

00:06:10.875 --> 00:06:12.042
[Buzzes] Yes, Sheriff.

00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:20.916
- [screams]
- [squeaks]

00:06:20.917 --> 00:06:21.832
[Atlas] Whoo!

00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:23.916
We have reached our destination.

00:06:23.917 --> 00:06:25.207
- Lily?
- Lily!

00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:27.124
- Lily, where are ya?
- [Smarty] Lily!

00:06:27.125 --> 00:06:28.707
- [Jessie] Lily?
- Lilypad, where you at?

00:06:28.708 --> 00:06:29.999
Hey, Lily.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.333
<i>Yes, can I help you?</i>

00:06:32.875 --> 00:06:35.791
Lily. It's okay. We got ya.

00:06:35.792 --> 00:06:37.082
You shouldn't have come, Jessie.

00:06:37.083 --> 00:06:39.166
Nuh-uh. No time for pity parties, Lily.

00:06:39.167 --> 00:06:41.416
Bonnie still needs you to make a friend.

00:06:41.417 --> 00:06:42.458
Me? But I...

00:06:43.458 --> 00:06:46.749
I made a major miscalculation
with Kara, Chelsea and Heidi.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.666
You were right. Bonnie's different.

00:06:48.667 --> 00:06:49.624
She deserves better.

00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:50.707
Lily.

00:06:50.708 --> 00:06:53.124
You didn't know those girls
were wrong for Bonnie.

00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:54.707
No, I'm wrong for Bonnie.

00:06:54.708 --> 00:06:57.749
- I'm the one who caused this.
- Well, then help me fix it.

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:59.999
I found Bonnie the right friend.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.207
- You did?
- Yep.

00:07:01.208 --> 00:07:03.457
So, how about you and me connect them?

00:07:03.458 --> 00:07:05.374
Uh... Okay.

00:07:05.375 --> 00:07:07.624
But first, we gotta get
everyone off this truck

00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:08.749
and back home.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:09.791
[screaming]

00:07:09.792 --> 00:07:11.083
[music continues]

00:07:11.917 --> 00:07:13.666
- [horn honks]
- [grunts]

00:07:13.667 --> 00:07:16.332
Uh, we are moving way too fast
to get off now.

00:07:16.333 --> 00:07:18.832
And we're going farther away
by the second.

00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:20.832
There's gotta be something we can do.

00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:23.041
We've got all these fancy Buzzes.

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:24.292
[gasps]

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.499
Excuse me. Move, move. Out of the way.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.833
Spaceman, turn around.

